<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>self love</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">jeniverse</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">self love</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4SwACU25XEVRNm8GRI1UrV</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">1 Contributor</p><p ttm:agent="v1">self love Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I took a train out to my city</p><p ttm:agent="v1">To tell my therapist my great story of my life</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She laughs concerned</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She said I'm glad you reached out</p><p ttm:agent="v1">At least I have prescribed Diazepam now</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Bridge]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh, God knows I need to calm down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ah, but I can't come down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">World moving at the speed of light</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Here I'm hanging on for dear life</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Everybody's got it goin on</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But still I gotta figure out self love</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And how to survive myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And the side of me that gives in to negative shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh, nothing can fix me, ah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Will I ever get enough self love?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Will I ever get enough self love?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I've been a sad underachiever</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm scared of failure, so for that I run and hide</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Wasted potential</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Could've been monumental</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh, so special</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But I'm not fucking special[Pre-Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh, God knows I need to calm down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ah, but I can't come down</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">World moving at the speed of light</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Here I'm hanging on for dear life</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Everybody's got it goin on</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But still I gotta figure out self love</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And how to survive myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And the side of me that gives in to negative shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh, nothing can fix me, ah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Will I ever get enough self love?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Will I ever get enough self love?)</p></div></body></tt>